---
title: "withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_canceled: check sale status
    q_check_canceled --> q_check_position: isCanceled == true
    q_check_canceled --> q_revert_not_canceled: isCanceled == false
    q_revert_not_canceled --> [*]: revert SaleNotCanceled
    q_check_position --> q_check_refunded: investedCapital > 0
    q_check_position --> q_revert_no_position: no invested capital
    q_revert_no_position --> [*]: revert NoPosition
    q_check_refunded --> q_transfer: hasRefunded == false
    q_check_refunded --> q_revert_refunded: hasRefunded == true
    q_revert_refunded --> [*]: revert AlreadyRefunded
    q_transfer --> q_update: transfer investedCapital of bidToken to investor
    q_update --> [*]: hasRefunded = true, emit InvestedCapitalWithdrawn

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: full investedCapital returned on cancellation
        INV-002: hasRefunded prevents double-withdrawal
    end note
